@startuml act_readiness_review
!include _style.puml
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam SwimlaneWidth same
|Project User|
start
:Open readiness view;
|Terra-Audit Server|
:Resolve active bundle,\napplicability, corrections;
:Compute evidence fingerprint;
:Evaluate requirements\n(satisfied / missing / needs_review /\nnot_applicable / unsupported);
if (Blocking items?) then (no)
  :Mark version\nready_for_review;
else (yes)
  :Expose blockers;\nversion stays draft;
  :Return blockers to user\n(add evidence or\nrecord determination);
  stop
endif
|Project User|
:Submit ready_for_review version;
|Terra-Audit Server|
:Create version-pinned\nsubmission (submitted);
|Internal Reviewer|
:Start review (in_review);
:Record findings / comments;
if (Open blocking finding?) then (yes)
  :Request changes\nor reject [reason];
else (no)
  :Approve internally\n[reason];
endif
|Terra-Audit Server|
:Append review_event\n(optimistic version check);
stop
@enduml
